 "strings": {
  "Not quite, he's out on a date\nwith a customer.": "",
  "Actually, he's out on a date\nwith a customer.": "",
  "Damn, he could be practically\nanywhere, then.": "",
  "A date? So what you're saying is... he could be\njust about anywhere in the city.": "",
  "Third day in a row, too.\nHe's got her wrapped around his finger!": "",
  "Third day in a row, too.\nSeiya's really on a roll this time!": "",
  "Yeah that's great.\nAny idea when he'll be back?": "",
  "I'm sure.\nAny idea when he'll be back?": "",
  "No clue.\nI doubt he went far, but that's all I've got.": "",
  "Well, hard to say... I doubt he went far,\nbut that's all I've got.": "",
  "All right, cool.\nThanks anyway.": "",
  "All right.\nWell, thanks anyway.": "",
  "(First the owner of Amour, now this guy.\nWhy can't people just stay at their clubs?)": "",
  "(Wait, maybe I can find him the same way as before.\nIt's worth a shot.)": "",
  "Seiya works over at Club Stardust.": "",
  "Seiya works as a host\nover at Club Stardust.": "",
  "Talk to him yourself if you wanna know more\nabout his run-in with Captain Hamura.": "",
  "Talk to him if you wanna know more.": "",
  "Yo, Tsukumo?": "",
  "Hey, Tsukumo.": "",
  "Oh, hey Yagami-shi. What's up?": "",
  "Yagami-shi! What's up?": "",
  "I, uh, I need something. Think you can\ndo another message search for me?": "",
  "Well, I'm out of options again. I think I'll\nneed another search. Can you help me out?": "",
  "Sure. Just hit me with\nthe keywords you need!": "",
  "Sure. Just give me a word!": "",
  "Hm. Let's go with \"Stardust\" and \"Seiya\".": "",
  "Let's see... We'll start with\n\"Stardust\" and \"Seiya.\"": "",
  "Oh, and let's limit the search history\nto just today.": "",
  "And it's gotta be from today.\nAnything else isn't gonna help me.": "",
  "You got it.\nGimme just a second here...": "",
  "You got it.\nJust a second here...": "",
  "It's working, it's working!\nI'll just push this to your screen.": "",
  "Hehe! There we go, there we go...\nYagami-shi, I'll toss these beauties to your screen.": "",
  "It mighta worked too well. Any other keywords\nyou want to narrow this down by?": "",
  "Mmm, that's still a whole ton of hits...\nMaybe you've got another keyword for me to narrow it down?": "",
  "Hmmm.": "",
  "Hmm. That helped, but there's a metric ton.\nWanna try a different word maybe?": "",
  "Hmmmm. That helped, but there's still way too many.\nLet's try a different word.": "",
  "Okay, how about...": "",
  "Oho! That did the trick!": "",
  "Great. Should be easy to check\nthese out myself. Thanks, Tsukumo.": "",
  "Great. Should be easy to check these out myself.\nI'll get working on these. Thanks!": "",
  "I'm sure you'll find your\npretty boy in no time!": "",
  "Yeah, three leads should be a cake-walk!\nHehe!": "",
  "(Damn, I got nothing...)": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-shi. Did you manage to\ntrack down that host of yours?": "",
  "Yagami-shi. Did you find your host,\nthat Seiya guy...?": "",
  "Nope. Struck out on all three leads.": "",
  "Hmmmm.\nHow about giving it another try?": "",
  "Hmmm, really... How about\ngiving it another try?": "",
  "Nah, I'm good.\nI'll figure out some other way.": "",
  "Huh? Nah, I'm good.\nI'll figure out some other way.": "",
  "Don't be such a sourpuss, Yagami-shi!\nI bet there have been more posts since earlier!": "",
  "Don't be such a soursport! I bet if we just check,\nwe'll find at least a couple more posts!": "",
  "Doubt that's gonna change much... But sure,\nwhy not? Let's see what you've got.": "",
  "Doubt that's gonna change much...\nBut sure. Let's see...": "",
  "Hehe. Let's start with the\nsame keywords from before.": "",
  "Well, we'll start with the same keywords.\nLet's just get those entered in here...": "",
  "See that? A new hit! The landscape\nof social media changes every second.": "",
  "There! A new post just a minute ago!\nI'm sending it to you, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "Apparently they posted it only a minute ago.\nIf that's not a hot lead, I don't know what is!": "",
  "If this post is only a minute old,\nI'd say that's a pretty hot lead!": "",
  "All right, I'll check it out.\nThanks for everything, Tsukumo.": "",
  "Hehe! Not a problem!": "",
  "Excuse me, ma'am.": "",
  "Do you have a sec?": "",
  "I'm looking for a host named Seiya.\nWorks at Stardust.": "",
  "I'm looking for a host named Seiya,\nwho works at Stardust...?": "",
  "Huh? What do you want with Seiya!?": "",
  "Huh? Seiya!?\nWhat do you want with him?": "",
  "...Uh, I need to ask him something.\nI heard he was on a date around here.": "",
  "Did you say date!? Who's the bitch\nhe's cheating on me with!?": "",
  "A date!? Who's the <font_kind=yakuza_italic>bitch</font_kind> he's\ncheating on me with!?": "",
  "Oh, uh. You know what, never mind.\nIt's fine.": "",
  "It is not fine!\nWhat the hell is going on!?": "",
  "It is <font_kind=yakuza_italic>not</font_kind> \"fine\"!\nWhat the hell is going on!?": "",
  "Oh, look at the time.\nGotta run!": "",
  "Wow, look at the time...!": "",
  "(Doesn't look like Seiya's here.\nI should try somewhere else.)": "",
  "...What is it?": "",
  "Wait, you know Seiya-kun?\nIs he all right!?": "",
  "We were gonna go on a date tonight,\nbut he never showed. I'm kinda worried...": "",
  "We were gonna go on a date tonight, but he never showed.\nI'm kinda worried...": "",
  "Huh? I'd heard he was on a date around here too,\nbut I guess that means it wasn't with you...": "",
  "Huh? From what I heard, he was already out on a date\nsomewhere around town right now...?": "",
  "Uh... Better luck next time?": "",
  "Though... I guess not with you.": "",
  "Wait, what?\nSeiya-kun's out with another girl!?": "",
  "Wait, what...?\nSeiya-kun's... with someone else?": "",
  "Sounds like it. But don't take it too hard,\nI'm sure you'll bounce back...": "",
  "Sounds like it... Well, still.\nDon't beat yourself up over it, okay?": "",
  "Oh, thank goodness he's safe! I thought he'd\ngotten into an accident or something!": "",
  "Oh, thank goodness! I'm glad Seiya's safe!\nI thought he'd gotten in an accident!": "",
  "I wonder if he's having fun on his date...\nAs long as he's happy, I'm happy...": "",
  "I wonder if Seiya's having fun on his date.\nIf my Seiya-kun is happy, I'm happy.": "",
  "(Either way, it doesn't look like Seiya's here.\nI should try somewhere else.)": "",
  "I hope Seiya-kun gets here soon...": "",
  "Wait a sec, You mean Seiya,\nthat host from Stardust?": "",
  "Hold on... Are you talking about Seiya,\nthe host from Stardust?": "",
  "Who are you?\nAre you from the club!?": "",
  "...Who are you?\nAre you from the club!?": "",
  "Uh... No, sorry.\nI'm just looking for Seiya.": "",
  "I'd ask where he is... But it looks like\nyou know as much as I do.": "",
  "I'd ask where he is...\nbut you're probably wondering too.": "",
  "Hey, are you implying\nmy Seiya-kun stood me up!?": "",
  "Wh-What do you mean!? Are you implying\nmy Seiya-kun stood me up!?": "",
  "I'm sure he's just taking his time\ngetting ready. He'll be here any minute!": "",
  "I'm sure he's just taking his time getting ready.\nHe'll be here any minute!": "",
  "Uh-huh... How long have you\nbeen waiting, anyway?": "",
  "Uh-huh... How long have you been\nwaiting, anyway?": "",
  "I... I...  ": "",
  "I... I...": "",
  "I shouldn't've asked.\nExcuse me.": "",
  "Uh, sorry. Bye now.": "",
  "Hey. Seiya, right?\nFrom Stardust?": "",
  "Sorry to butt in. You have a sec?": "",
  "You'll have to excuse me,\nMai-chan. I won't be long.": "",
  "Excuse me, Mai-chan.\nI won't be long.": "",
  "Hey, is everything okay?": "",
  "Huh?\nIs everything okay?": "",
  "Don't worry, it'll all be fine.": "",
  "Don't worry, it'll be fine.": "",
  "Mind stepping outside, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Mind stepping outside... Yagami-san?": "",
  "Wait, you know who I am?": "",
  "I do.": "",
  "The owner over at Tender\ntold me about you.": "",
  "Masuda over at Tender\ntold me about you.": "",
  "Thought I'd ask you to do me a favor.": "",
  "So, I thought I'd ask you\nto do me a favor.": "",
  "You want to get back at\na yakuza who hit you, yeah?": "",
  "You want to get back at\na yakuza who hit you?": "",
  "Yes. He said you might\nbe able to manage something.": "",
  "...Yes. He said you might be able to\nmanage something.": "",
  "A disgraced ex-lawyer who's not afraid\nto get his hands a little dirty.": "",
  "A disgraced ex-lawyer, who's not afraid to\nget his hands a little dirty.": "",
  "Sounds like you're pretty\nwell-known in Kamurocho.": "",
  "You're pretty well-known in Kamurocho,\nby Masuda's account.": "",
  "So that's what people say about me?": "",
  "Huh. So that's what people say.": "",
  "One more thing. This is just a rumor, but,\nuh, I hear you'll do anything for your clients.": "",
  "One more thing. This is just a rumor,\nbut I hear you'll do anything for your clients.": "",
  "You even got a murderer\noff the hook, right?": "",
  "I mean, you even got a murderer\noff the hook, right?": "",
  "Oh, did I say something wrong?": "",
  "Hm? Did I... say something wrong?": "",
  "No, it's all right. Anyway.\nYou said Captain Hamura hit you?": "",
  "No, it's all right.\nAnyway. You said Captain Hamura hit you?": "",
  "When?": "",
  "When was this?": "",
  "The night of December 3rd.": "",
  "The day of the murder.": "",
  "The day of that yakuza murder, right?": "",
  "You're sure?": "",
  "You're sure, though?": "",
  "Funny enough, I've been hired to look into Hamura's\ncase. This story of yours could be key evidence.": "",
  "Funny enough, I've been hired to look into Hamura's case.\nThis story of yours could be key evidence.": "",
  "That so? Not sure I wanna be\nthe guy who sets him free.": "",
  "That so? Not sure I wanna be the guy\nwho sets him free.": "",
  "I know you two have a history,\nbut I need this. Please.": "",
  "How could I say no to a celebrity\nlike you? It's fine.": "",
  "How could I say no to a bowing celebrity?\nOkay... I'll talk for you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Yes! I might be able to prove Hamura's alibi now.)</color>": "",
  "What time did you run into Hamura?": "",
  "So about your encounter with Hamura.\nWhen was that?": "",
  "I think around midnight, out in front of\nKyushu No. 1 Star. Not the busiest place.": "",
  "I think around midnight. In Pink Alley near Kyushu No. 1 Star.\nThat quiet little ramen place. Not exactly busy.": "",
  "Kyushu No. 1 Star...\nIsn't that near Sauna Goten?": "",
  "Yeah, it is.": "",
  "Yeah, I think so.": "",
  "Mind telling me more?\nWhy'd he hit you in the first place?": "",
  "Mind telling me more?\nWhy'd Hamura hit you in the first place?": "",
  "Wish I knew.\nThe guy reeked of booze, though.": "",
  "I'd like to know that myself.\nGotta say, the guy reeked of booze.": "",
  "I was just walking down the street\nwhen I noticed him coming towards me.": "",
  "I was just walking down the street,\nthen I saw him stumbling my way.": "",
  "He was like, mumbling to himself\nor something. Kinda scary shit.": "",
  "He was mumbling to himself, too.\nKind of freaking me out.": "",
  "I tried to avoid him,\nbut he just barrelled towards me anyway.": "",
  "I tried moving to the other side of the alleyway,\nbut he followed me anyway.": "",
  "And how many times did he hit you?": "",
  "Just the once.": "",
  "It left a fucking nasty bruise, though!\nKnocked one of my fillings clean out, too.": "",
  "But it still left a fucking nasty bruise!\nKnocked one of my fillings clean out.": "",
  "A filling, huh?\nDid you go to the dentist?": "",
  "Hm? Yeah, the next day.": "",
  "Then you'll be in their records.\nThat'll corroborate your testimony.": "",
  "Ah, so that's what you were getting at.": "",
  "Ah, I see your point.": "",
  "Moving on.\nWhat did Hamura do after he hit you?": "",
  "Now, after he hit you...\nwhat did Hamura do?": "",
  "He stumbled away into a sauna.\nThat Goten place you mentioned.": "",
  "Stumbled off. Went into a sauna...\nYeah, I think it was Sauna Goten.": "",
  "So just to recap. He hit you around 12,\nand then headed into Sauna Goten.": "",
  "So around 12, after hitting you in an alley,\nHamura wandered into Sauna Goten.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The old guy at Sauna Goten said that\nno one left the place until morning.)</color>": "",
  "Then as long as I can prove\nHamura was here... we'll have our alibi.": "",
  "And can I count on your\ntestimony in court?": "",
  "And can I count on that story in court?\nCan you testify?": "",
  "Okay, sure.": "",
  "It'd be nice to have the great Yagami-san owe me a favor.\nMaybe Masuda could give me a few freebies, too.": "",
  "It'd be nice having you owe me a favor.\nMaybe Masuda could give me a few freebies, too.": "",
  "Sure, I'll ask him.": "",
  "Hey, one more thing.": "",
  "Wait! One more thing.": "",
  "Did you see any security cameras around when you ran\ninto Hamura? Video evidence would lock this up for me.": "",
  "When you ran into Hamura, were there cameras around?\nVideo evidence would lock this up for me.": "",
  "Hm, couldn't say.\nI don't usually look for that stuff.": "",
  "Hm... couldn't really say.\nI don't usually look for that stuff.": "",
  "Right. Well, thanks anyway.\nI'll be in touch.": "",
  "Right... Thanks anyway.\nI'll be in touch.": "",
  "Of course. See ya.": "",
  "Sure. Later.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So, it went down in front of\nKyushu No. 1 Star.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's the best lead I've got right now.\nLet's hope they have a camera...)</color>": "",
  "Yo, it's me.\nYou find Ayabe yet?": "",
  "Yo, it's Kaito.\nYou find Ayabe yet?": "",
  "Negative. But I did track down someone\nwho had a run-in with Hamura.": "",
  "Negative. But I did track down a host\nwho had a run-in with Hamura.": "",
  "Yeah? Is it good news?": "",
  "Huh? For what?": "",
  "His alibi might be more\nairtight than we thought.": "",
  "Hamura's alibi might be more\nairtight than we thought.": "",
  "You're kidding me.": "",
  "Just around midnight on the day of the crime, this guy\nSeiya got hit by Hamura, then saw him go to the sauna.": "",
  "Just around midnight on the day of the crime,\nthis host Seiya got hit by Hamura, then saw him go to the sauna.": "",
  "It was apparently right by Kyushu No. 1 Star.\nIf they have a security camera, it would've caught everything.": "",
  "It was apparently right by Kyushu No. 1 Star.\nIf they have a security camera... it would've caught everything.": "",
  "I'm heading to check it out now.": "",
  "I'm heading over now.": "",
  "Hold up, Isn't that near KJ Art?\nThose Kyorei guys won't be happy to see you.": "",
  "Hey... Isn't that near the KJ Art building?\nThose Kyorei guys won't be happy to see you.": "",
  "If I was worried about getting seen,\nI'd never leave the office.": "",
  "Heh, fair enough.\nLater.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This is where Seiya got hit.\nA security camera would have caught something...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So there <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> a camera!)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Let's hope Hamura's on there...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This... has nothing to do with the case.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I've dealt with enough of these things for today.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The place is dingy, but damn if it isn't good.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Their ramen is a Kamurocho classic.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(According to Seiya, Hamura punched him\nnear Kyushu No. 1 Star.)</color>": "",
  "Please tell me you found\nsomething. You did, right?": "",
  "Please tell me you found\nsomething, Tak.": "",
  "Think I did.\nCheck out that camera.": "",
  "Think I did.\nLook, there's a camera.": "",
  "We're in the clear if that thing\nputs Hamura here at midnight.": "",
  "If that captured Hamura's fight with the host,\nhis alibi's solid. We're in the clear.": "",
  "And if it doesn't?": ""
 },
